        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Public interest in political memoirs increases when they contain humorous or unexpected details.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "The term 'whiteboard' gaining slang usage reflects informal power dynamics in political institutions.",
