  {
    "episode_id": 92669,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92669.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "So how is this desire to hold people to account, which you say is far too rare, to be able to take these moments and hearings to educate the American public? Is it connected to your desire to be in the Senate, why you want to be a Senator?",
