    "turn_idx": 16,
    "turn_text": "Yes, that is the broader context of what is happening, but to be able to enshrine some kind of a right to an abortion, that is a very difficult task, and just really wondering what tools are available in terms of a legislative fix, given the kinds of stalemates that we're seeing.",
