      {
        "text": "Voters value consistency between representation and shared values more than strict partisan alignment.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Democratic leadership should prioritize pragmatic coalition-building over ideological purity.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker has the credibility and influence to mobilize support effectively as a Senator.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Continuity of Democratic representation in Orange County is both desirable and achievable through targeted effort.",
