  {
    "episode_id": 92669,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92669.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 39,
    "turn_text": "Thanks, Nadine. The LA Times reported yesterday that according to federal campaign finance documents released on Saturday that your colleague, Congressman Adam Schiff, has raised millions of dollars more than you. I think that he's got about a $14 million advantage. It's early, of course, but that was one of the things that came out in the report. But I want to bring this up because there is a question about how concerned folks should be about your ability to catch up, to raise the resources needed in a state like California where it is expensive to run a Senate campaign.",
