    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92669.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 41,
    "turn_text": "Congress member Katie Porter is with us today. And so are you our listeners. Let me go next to Frank in San Jose. And again, you can join by calling 867336786. The lines are full, but keep trying. Frank, you're on. Go right ahead.",
