        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Democratic leadership has sufficient influence to reshape institutional norms regarding campaign funding.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Ethical fundraising practices are foundational to meaningful democratic representation.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Government officials should be held accountable for financial relationships that could undermine public service.",
        "confidence": 0.87
