        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker wants to explore the theme of money and power further.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker requests a concrete example to clarify the claim about wealth dividing people in Congress.",
        "confidence": 0.9
