  {
    "episode_id": 92669,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92669.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 50,
    "turn_text": "Hi, thanks a lot. My question borders on what Katie just was talking about. It really stuck in my mind when they said she was a single mom with three children to raise. My husband and I raised two children together and I know what a struggle it is. I'm just curious to know how she manages. Does she have help with her children at home? Does she leave her children with someone when she's working in Washington? I'm just curious to know at the nitty gritty of how she does it.",
